{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011Ch1stvFqZisEQDEj5khmB", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I signed off with no confirmed bugs, at 0.6 confidence. I filed one report, and the developer replied \"could not reproduce with the steps given.\"\n\nThe report was about Default list. The task editor shows \"Default list\" for the seeded tasks, but opening Default list from the drawer showed \"There are no tasks here.\" I think the seed data caused this, so I treated the report as a likely false positive.\n\n**What I tested**\n- **Custom repeat dialog:** it loaded the existing rule correctly for hourly (Water plants), daily with 1 occurrence (Final dose), every 2 weeks (Weekly review), weekly and monthly (Pay rent). I also set a custom rule (every 3 days, 2 occurrences) and saw the right summary.\n- **Completing repeating tasks:** Water plants rescheduled to 11 AM, Weekly review to December 28 and Pay rent to January 4, 2027. Final dose completed and dropped off the list. I undid each one afterwards.\n- **Sort sheet:** changing the sort field and direction gave the right order. Subtask sort by title, ascending and descending, ordered Print tickets and Charge phone correctly. My order is disabled in My Tasks and enabled in Default list.\n- **Subtasks:** nesting, collapsing and rotating the screen worked. A new parent with two subtasks in Default list in My order kept the order Alpha, Beta.\n\n**Side effects on the data**\n- My Tasks sort is now by title, with subtasks sorted by title descending. Default list is on My order.\n- I created \"Parent task\" with subtasks \"Alpha sub\" and \"Beta sub\" in Default list. They are still there.\n- I changed Read docs' repeat but discarded the edit, so it is unchanged.\n\n**What I did not check:** grouping options other than \"By due date\", and the \"Show completed\" and \"Move completed tasks to bottom\" toggles."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 322, "cache_read_input_tokens": 103648, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 322}, "output_tokens": 623, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "cdccae2a-0857-4ff6-b148-afbb17f7d208", "uuid": "0cd4fea9-7311-40a5-ab35-808ddfdcfd14", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T00:31:51.542Z", "request_id": "req_011Ch1stuyxbmwzu2vyu8uKa"}
